WEBVTT

00:00.990 --> 00:06.930
Zankoku na tenshi no you ni

00:00.990 --> 00:06.930
Just like the cruel angel

00:06.930 --> 00:14.590
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

00:06.930 --> 00:14.590
Young boy, become a legend

00:18.990 --> 00:22.410
2D4U PRESENTS:

00:22.770 --> 00:25.810
Aoi kaze ga ima

00:22.770 --> 00:25.810
Even though the untested breeze...

00:25.810 --> 00:29.510
mune no doa o tataitemo

00:25.810 --> 00:29.510
...taps at the door to your heart

00:29.510 --> 00:36.970
Watashi dake o tada mitsumete hohoenderu anata

00:29.510 --> 00:36.970
You just look solely at me and smile

00:37.560 --> 00:44.500
Sotto fureru mono motomeru koto ni muchuu de

00:37.560 --> 00:44.500
So intent on seeking out that gentle touch

00:44.500 --> 00:51.400
Unmei sae mada shiranai itaike na hitomi

00:44.500 --> 00:51.400
Such innocent eyes, still ignorant of their destiny

00:52.000 --> 00:55.750
Dakedo itsuka kizuku deshou

00:52.000 --> 00:55.750
But someday, you are sure to realize...

00:55.750 --> 00:58.340
sono senaka ni wa

00:55.750 --> 00:58.340
...that upon your back

00:59.510 --> 01:02.960
Haruka mirai mezasu tame

00:59.510 --> 01:02.960
You have the wings with which to fly...

01:02.960 --> 01:06.310
no hane ga aru koto

01:02.960 --> 01:06.310
...towards the distant future

01:06.990 --> 01:10.690
Zankoku na tenshi no teeze

01:06.990 --> 01:10.690
The cruel angel's thesis

01:10.690 --> 01:14.430
Madobe kara yagate tobidatsu

01:10.690 --> 01:14.430
Soon, you will take flight from the windowsill

01:14.430 --> 01:18.200
Hotobashiru atsui patosu de

01:14.430 --> 01:18.200
With your torrent of ardent pathos

01:18.200 --> 01:21.900
Omoide o uragiru nara

01:18.200 --> 01:21.900
If you are to betray our memories

01:21.900 --> 01:25.540
Kono sora o daite kagayaku

01:21.900 --> 01:25.540
You, who embrace these heavens and shine

01:25.540 --> 01:29.270
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

01:25.540 --> 01:29.270
Young boy, become a legend

01:35.190 --> 01:37.200
The second and third Ashino Lakes,

01:37.200 --> 01:39.450
I hope there won't be any more of those.

01:40.530 --> 01:44.290
I received a complaint from
Chairman Kiel about the delay.

01:44.290 --> 01:45.750
It came directly to me.

01:46.460 --> 01:51.380
He was pretty upset.
He even hinted at dismissing you.

01:51.790 --> 01:53.760
Adam is proceeding well,

01:53.760 --> 01:56.590
and the Eva Project has begun work
on the dummy plugs.

01:56.880 --> 01:59.760
What do the old men of Seele
have to complain about?

01:59.760 --> 02:02.720
The all-important Human Instrumentality Project
is behind schedule.

02:03.430 --> 02:07.270
All the projects are linked.
There are no problems.

02:07.270 --> 02:08.850
Including Rei?

02:09.980 --> 02:11.150
Well, never mind.

02:12.020 --> 02:14.440
By the way, what should we do about that man?

02:14.440 --> 02:18.110
We'll leave him to his own devices.
The same with the Marduk Institute.

02:18.110 --> 02:20.910
I suppose we'll let him work to our purposes
for a while longer.

02:22.160 --> 02:24.660
KYOTO

02:24.950 --> 02:28.370
What started here, sixteen years ago?

02:45.100 --> 02:47.770
EPISODE 15
LIES AND SILENCE

02:50.650 --> 02:52.440
It's me.

02:53.770 --> 02:55.190
Yes, so it is.

02:56.070 --> 02:59.700
Shannon Bio, a chemical firm
funded from overseas.

03:00.200 --> 03:04.910
It's been here for nine years,
but it also hasn't changed in nine years.

03:05.490 --> 03:09.040
The Marduk Institute has
108 affiliated companies.

03:09.040 --> 03:11.210
106 of them turned out to be
dummy corporations.

03:11.210 --> 03:13.500
And this is the 107th?

03:13.880 --> 03:16.000
This is the corporate registration.

03:16.000 --> 03:18.300
You want me to take a look
at the board of directors, right?

03:18.630 --> 03:22.010
Gendo Ikari

03:18.630 --> 03:22.010
Kouzou Fuyutsuki

03:18.630 --> 03:22.010
Kiel Lorenz

03:18.920 --> 03:20.510
So you already knew about it?

03:20.510 --> 03:22.550
The names are all familiar.

03:22.550 --> 03:27.350
The Marduk Institute is supposed to be
an advisory body

03:27.350 --> 03:30.600
controlled by the Human Instrumentality
Committee to select Eva pilots.

03:30.600 --> 03:32.850
What it really does is not clear.

03:32.850 --> 03:35.730
Your duty is to investigate Nerv.

03:35.730 --> 03:38.110
Getting involved in the Marduk Institute
is a bad idea.

03:38.110 --> 03:43.610
Well, I'm the type that has to see
everything for myself.

03:44.910 --> 03:48.290
Hi, this is Kaji. I'm out right now.

03:48.290 --> 03:51.000
Please leave your name and message.

03:53.790 --> 03:57.500
Help me, Mr. Kaji! Don't touch me, you pervert!

03:58.670 --> 04:00.670
Not.

04:00.670 --> 04:02.430
What's going on?

04:02.430 --> 04:04.220
Well, tomorrow's Sunday.

04:04.590 --> 04:10.560
So I called Mr. Kaji, thinking that I'd get him
to take me out somewhere, but he's not in.

04:11.140 --> 04:13.810
He's always out lately, no matter when I call.

04:13.810 --> 04:15.480
That means you're free tomorrow, right?

04:16.400 --> 04:18.820
Regrettably, yes.

04:18.820 --> 04:21.900
Then I have a little favor to ask of you.

04:22.240 --> 04:23.950
Well, it's like this...

04:25.490 --> 04:28.160
What?! A date?!

04:28.160 --> 04:30.330
A friend of my big sister Kodama

04:30.330 --> 04:33.120
is insisting that I introduce you to him.

04:33.460 --> 04:34.420
Please!

04:46.890 --> 04:48.350
Head!

04:48.350 --> 04:50.180
Get to it!

04:50.180 --> 04:51.060
I'm sorry.

04:51.060 --> 04:53.310
YOU need to get to it and clean!

04:53.310 --> 04:55.230
Necrosis operation complete.

04:55.230 --> 04:57.020
Graph measurement complete.

04:57.020 --> 04:59.150
What are you going to wear tomorrow?
Synch rate is normal.

04:59.150 --> 05:01.230
Oh, to the wedding?

05:01.230 --> 05:04.360
I wore the pink suit for Kiyomi's wedding,

05:04.360 --> 05:07.370
and the dark blue dress for Kotoko's
just the other day.

05:07.370 --> 05:08.530
What about the orange one?

05:08.530 --> 05:10.080
You haven't worn that one lately, have you?

05:10.080 --> 05:13.330
Well, there's a reason for that.

05:13.330 --> 05:14.620
It's too tight?

05:14.620 --> 05:16.210
Yeah, so what?!

05:17.120 --> 05:18.580
Should I get a new one on the way home?

05:20.500 --> 05:22.380
It's an extra expense.

05:22.800 --> 05:26.630
We've been invited to so many weddings lately,
the cost of all the gifts is starting to add up.

05:26.630 --> 05:30.560
Everyone's just rushing to get married
before they're thirty.

05:30.560 --> 05:33.680
No one wants to be the last one still single.

05:34.310 --> 05:36.730
That's enough, you three.

05:36.730 --> 05:38.310
Good work.

05:38.860 --> 05:41.020
All these stupid tests are boring!

05:44.280 --> 05:48.660
By the way, Shinji looks even more
downcast than usual today.

05:49.280 --> 05:50.990
That's because of tomorrow.

05:51.450 --> 05:53.330
Yes, tomorrow.

05:54.330 --> 05:57.790
Tomorrow, I have to see my father.

05:59.630 --> 06:02.210
What should I talk to him about?

06:02.210 --> 06:04.760
Why do you ask me?

06:04.760 --> 06:08.590
Because I once saw you
talking happily with him.

06:11.550 --> 06:15.310
Say, what kind of person is my father?

06:16.980 --> 06:18.690
I don't know.

06:20.810 --> 06:22.020
I see.

06:22.020 --> 06:25.530
You've been looking at me all afternoon
because you wanted to ask me that?

06:27.190 --> 06:32.200
When we were cleaning today,
you were wringing out the cloth, remember?

06:32.200 --> 06:34.620
The way you did it was like a mother.

06:35.330 --> 06:37.040
A mother?

06:39.210 --> 06:43.630
I thought it was like a mother.

06:44.500 --> 06:48.220
Maybe you'd be really good
at being a housewife, Ayanami.

06:51.430 --> 06:52.970
What are you saying?!

06:54.850 --> 06:59.100
<i><i>What do you mean? You're the one
that wanted to break up!</i></i>

06:57.390 --> 06:59.100
I'm home.

06:59.100 --> 07:00.480
Welcome back.

06:59.270 --> 07:03.690
<i><i>I was wrong. I wasn't thinking back then.</i></i>

07:00.480 --> 07:03.770
You'd better go to bed.
Aren't you going on a date tomorrow?

07:03.690 --> 07:05.820
<i><i>What are you saying at this late date?</i></i>

07:03.770 --> 07:05.820
Yeah, with a hunk.

07:05.820 --> 07:09.610
<i><i>I don't know about you,
but I'm a different person now!</i></i>

07:06.690 --> 07:10.200
Hey, that's right, let me use
your lavender perfume!

07:09.610 --> 07:12.110
<i><i>But I still love you!</i></i>

07:10.200 --> 07:11.160
Absolutely not.

07:11.160 --> 07:13.160
Jeez, cheapskate!

07:12.110 --> 07:15.620
<i><i>Time and people are two things that can't be
turned back to the way they were!</i></i>

07:13.160 --> 07:15.450
It's not for kids.

07:15.450 --> 07:16.540
Is Shinji in his room?

07:15.620 --> 07:18.000
<i><i>I can never go back to the way I was!</i></i>

07:16.540 --> 07:18.160
He's been in there since he got back.

07:18.000 --> 07:19.830
<i><i>But I really do still love you!</i></i>

07:18.160 --> 07:20.210
It looks like he doesn't want to see his father.

07:19.830 --> 07:22.330
<i><i>I'm telling you, it's impossible!</i></i>

07:20.210 --> 07:22.000
If he doesn't want to, he should just say so.

07:22.000 --> 07:24.170
I don't understand the Japanese.

07:22.330 --> 07:27.880
<i><i>It took me three years to forget you! It's too late!</i></i>

07:24.170 --> 07:26.380
Well, it's not that he doesn't want to.

07:26.840 --> 07:28.460
That's the problem.

07:34.140 --> 07:34.760
Leave!

07:39.350 --> 07:42.400
Well done, Shinji.

07:45.020 --> 07:47.110
Shinji?

07:47.110 --> 07:48.690
I'm opening the door.

07:52.320 --> 07:55.320
Are you scared? Of seeing
your father by yourself?

07:57.030 --> 07:59.200
You can't keep running away.

07:59.200 --> 08:02.080
Unless you take that step forward,
nothing will change.

08:02.710 --> 08:04.460
I know that!

08:05.130 --> 08:07.000
You'll begin to realize,

08:07.000 --> 08:11.510
after that first step, it's just as important
to keep going.

08:12.130 --> 08:15.470
Anyway, go see him tomorrow
with your chin held high,

08:15.470 --> 08:17.140
because you'll be seeing your mother too.

08:17.640 --> 08:19.430
Well, good night.

08:24.980 --> 08:28.190
Hey, you bought a new dress for tomorrow,
didn't you? Let me see!

08:28.190 --> 08:30.530
Oh, you want to see?
It was expensive, you know.

08:30.530 --> 08:32.070
Taste is more important than price.

08:32.070 --> 08:33.740
I've got that down pat.

08:33.740 --> 08:37.620
Did you pick based on Mr. Kaji's
taste and stuff after all?

08:37.620 --> 08:39.410
I think not. Not anymore.

08:39.450 --> 08:41.120
NEXT DAY

08:41.290 --> 08:41.830
Well!

08:41.830 --> 08:42.460
See you...

08:42.460 --> 08:43.040
Later.

08:49.460 --> 08:51.920
<i>Place three bags in your heart...</i>

08:51.920 --> 08:55.130
<i>Red, blue, and yellow...</i>

08:55.130 --> 08:57.340
Now let us proceed with the reception.

08:57.340 --> 08:58.220
Mr. Ryoji Kaji

08:59.850 --> 09:01.430
Ryo's late.

09:01.430 --> 09:05.310
That idiot has never been on time
in his entire life!

09:05.310 --> 09:08.610
For your dates, you mean?
He's always on time for work.

09:08.610 --> 09:12.320
Hey, you two! You look
even more beautiful today.

09:12.320 --> 09:14.650
I couldn't get off work in time.

09:14.650 --> 09:16.910
As if you're not puttering
around the office all the time.

09:17.870 --> 09:21.160
Not that I care, but couldn't you have done
something about that stubble?

09:21.160 --> 09:23.000
Look, your necktie is crooked.

09:23.500 --> 09:25.460
Well, thank you.

09:25.460 --> 09:27.330
You two act like you're married.

09:27.630 --> 09:29.500
Sounds good to me, Ritchan.

09:29.500 --> 09:30.670
Like hell I'd take him.

09:45.640 --> 09:49.060
It's been three years since the last time
we came here together.

09:49.360 --> 09:52.360
I ran away then,

09:52.690 --> 09:54.820
and haven't been back since.

09:54.820 --> 09:59.240
It just hasn't sunk in that Mother is resting here.

09:59.240 --> 10:00.950
I don't even remember her face.

10:00.950 --> 10:03.990
Man survives by forgetting his memories,

10:03.990 --> 10:07.000
but there are some things
a man should never forget.

10:07.000 --> 10:10.500
Yui taught me about the irreplaceable things.

10:10.500 --> 10:13.750
I come here to confirm that.

10:15.590 --> 10:17.260
You have no pictures of her?

10:17.260 --> 10:18.760
There are none left.

10:18.760 --> 10:21.720
This grave is just a decoration too.
There's no corpse.

10:21.720 --> 10:25.850
So, the teacher was right.
You threw them all away.

10:25.850 --> 10:28.850
I keep everything in my heart.
That is enough for now.

10:32.230 --> 10:34.230
It's time. I'm leaving now.

10:41.910 --> 10:42.580
Father!

10:44.700 --> 10:49.210
Um, I'm glad I got to talk to you today.

10:50.080 --> 10:51.960
I see.

11:35.880 --> 11:39.720
Not bad! I didn't know you played.

11:39.720 --> 11:43.180
I've been studying since I was five,
and this is all I can do,

11:43.180 --> 11:44.890
so I don't really have any talent.

11:44.890 --> 11:48.100
Perseverance is power. I'm a little impressed.

11:48.100 --> 11:50.350
I started studying because
my teacher told me to,

11:50.350 --> 11:51.980
so I could have quit anytime.

11:51.980 --> 11:54.440
Then why did you keep going?

11:54.440 --> 11:56.520
Because nobody told me to stop.

11:56.520 --> 11:58.780
I should have known!

11:58.780 --> 12:02.320
You came back early.
I thought you'd have dinner too.

12:02.320 --> 12:04.620
He was just so boring!

12:04.620 --> 12:09.160
So, while he was waiting in line
for the roller coaster, I left.

12:09.160 --> 12:11.000
That doesn't seem too nice.

12:11.000 --> 12:14.710
Really, Mr. Kaji is the only real man around.

12:16.090 --> 12:18.670
What're you saying after all this time?

12:18.670 --> 12:20.920
I'm ducking out to the restroom.

12:20.920 --> 12:22.130
Don't ditch me now!

12:27.550 --> 12:29.680
High heels...

12:29.680 --> 12:32.770
How many years has it been since
the three of us last drank together?

12:32.770 --> 12:34.520
Isn't Misato drinking too much?

12:34.520 --> 12:36.690
She's acting a little giddy.

12:36.690 --> 12:40.030
And you drink some more to
keep your high spirits in check.

12:40.570 --> 12:42.440
Or vice versa, today.

12:42.440 --> 12:46.160
As someone who lived with her,
your words carry the weight of truth.

12:46.530 --> 12:48.280
Well, I did live with her,

12:48.280 --> 12:51.200
but that was before she started
wearing heels and things.

12:51.200 --> 12:54.250
It was unimaginable when
we were back in school.

12:54.250 --> 12:56.130
I was a brat too.

12:56.130 --> 13:01.050
That wasn't really sharing a life.
It was just living together, playing house.

13:01.050 --> 13:03.170
Reality isn't that easy.

13:03.170 --> 13:05.680
Oh yeah, here. A cat souvenir.

13:05.680 --> 13:07.970
My, thank you. You're very thorough.

13:07.970 --> 13:10.560
Only with the ladies.
When it comes to work, I'm sloppy.

13:10.560 --> 13:12.470
I somehow doubt that.

13:12.470 --> 13:13.730
What about for Misato?

13:13.730 --> 13:15.390
I lost once before.

13:15.390 --> 13:17.520
I make a point of not fighting
when I can't win the battle.

13:17.520 --> 13:19.360
I think you have a chance at victory.

13:19.360 --> 13:20.570
What about you?

13:20.570 --> 13:22.990
I make a point of not talking about myself,

13:22.990 --> 13:24.110
because it's no fun.

13:25.110 --> 13:28.740
Katsuragi's sure taking a long time.
Maybe she's fixing her make-up?

13:29.370 --> 13:32.040
What were you doing in Kyoto?

13:32.040 --> 13:34.460
Huh? That's from Matsushiro.

13:34.460 --> 13:35.870
It's no use playing dumb.

13:35.870 --> 13:38.670
Your fingers will get burned if you
get involved in this too deeply.

13:38.670 --> 13:41.250
That's the advice of a friend.

13:41.250 --> 13:43.010
I'll take it seriously,

13:43.010 --> 13:46.340
but if I have to get burned, I'd rather be burned
while playing with fire along with you.

13:45.130 --> 13:47.550
Shall I go buy you some fireworks?

13:47.550 --> 13:48.550
Welcome back!

13:48.550 --> 13:50.930
You haven't changed, have you, you player?

13:50.930 --> 13:55.060
Of course I've changed. To live is to change.

13:55.060 --> 13:57.690
Homeostasis and transistasis.

13:57.690 --> 13:58.690
What are those?

13:58.690 --> 14:01.770
One is a force for the status quo,
and the other's a force for change.

14:01.770 --> 14:06.030
A living thing is something that has
both of these conflicting qualities.

14:06.030 --> 14:07.860
Like men and women.

14:08.320 --> 14:11.370
Well, I'll be leaving now.
I've still got some work to do.

14:11.370 --> 14:12.530
Really?

14:12.530 --> 14:13.790
Sorry to hear it.

14:13.790 --> 14:15.370
Later.

14:22.670 --> 14:25.840
Hey, Shin? It's me.

14:25.840 --> 14:29.760
I'm drinking with Kaji right now.
Right, we're on the third after-party.

14:29.760 --> 14:33.060
Yes... Okay, later.

14:33.060 --> 14:34.060
Was it Misato?

14:34.060 --> 14:37.100
Yes, she said she'll be late,
so don't wait up for her.

14:37.100 --> 14:40.150
What? Don't tell me she's coming back
in the morning!

14:40.150 --> 14:42.610
No way, she's with Mr. Kaji.

14:42.610 --> 14:44.940
What are you, stupid? That's WHY!

14:51.030 --> 14:53.330
You shouldn't be throwing up at your age.

14:53.330 --> 14:56.160
So sorry I'm that age.

14:56.160 --> 14:57.790
I guess we're both that age.

14:57.790 --> 14:59.290
Damn right.

14:59.290 --> 15:02.170
You're wearing heels now, after all.

15:02.170 --> 15:03.500
Time's really flown.

15:04.460 --> 15:07.130
Shave that stubble off.

15:07.460 --> 15:08.920
Yes, Ma'am.

15:09.340 --> 15:11.680
I'll walk the rest of the way. Thanks.

15:16.430 --> 15:19.770
Kaji, do you think I've changed?

15:20.520 --> 15:22.230
You've become more beautiful.

15:23.560 --> 15:27.820
I'm sorry that I insisted on
breaking up with you.

15:27.820 --> 15:30.780
When I said I fell in love with somebody else,

15:30.780 --> 15:33.160
that was a lie. Did you know?

15:33.160 --> 15:34.740
No.

15:36.910 --> 15:39.040
It's just that I realized

15:39.040 --> 15:42.080
you were like my father.

15:44.630 --> 15:50.010
That I wanted a man like my father...

15:50.010 --> 15:53.220
When I realized that, I was afraid.

15:53.510 --> 15:55.640
I was desperately afraid.

15:56.260 --> 15:58.890
Of being with you, Kaji...

15:58.890 --> 16:01.270
Of being a woman...

16:01.270 --> 16:03.980
I was afraid of everything.

16:04.940 --> 16:09.230
I hated my father, but fell in love
with someone just like him.

16:10.110 --> 16:13.110
I chose Nerv, intending to
make a clean break with the past.

16:13.660 --> 16:16.700
But even that was an organization
that Father used to belong to.

16:16.700 --> 16:21.210
In the end, I've been fooling myself
by taking revenge against the Angels.

16:26.500 --> 16:29.170
That was your decision, Katsuragi.

16:29.170 --> 16:31.260
You don't have to apologize to me.

16:31.260 --> 16:34.050
No, that wasn't a decision!

16:34.050 --> 16:36.430
I was just running away.

16:36.430 --> 16:39.220
Running away from the snare of my father!

16:39.220 --> 16:41.770
I'm just like Shinji.

16:41.770 --> 16:43.350
I'm a coward.

16:44.230 --> 16:48.400
I'm really sorry. Telling you all this now
because I drank too much...

16:48.400 --> 16:49.360
That's enough.

16:49.360 --> 16:51.110
I'm such a child.

16:51.110 --> 16:53.450
I have no right to tell Shinji anything.

16:53.450 --> 16:54.450
That's enough!

16:54.450 --> 16:59.450
On top of that, I'm an underhanded woman
that just clings to men when it suits me!

16:59.450 --> 17:02.790
Even back then, I may have just been using you!

17:02.790 --> 17:04.410
I hate myself!

17:03.460 --> 17:05.210
That's enough! Stop it!

17:04.710 --> 17:07.170
I'm so pathetic!

17:30.190 --> 17:33.900
Hey, Shinji, do you want to kiss?

17:33.900 --> 17:34.360
What?

17:34.360 --> 17:37.110
A kiss. A kiss? You've never kissed, right?

17:38.950 --> 17:40.620
Then, let's do it.

17:40.620 --> 17:41.330
Why?

17:41.330 --> 17:42.950
Because I'm bored.

17:42.950 --> 17:45.790
Because you're bored?! But...

17:45.790 --> 17:49.250
You don't want to kiss a girl on
the anniversary of your mom's death?

17:49.250 --> 17:51.920
Afraid she may be watching you from Heaven?

17:51.920 --> 17:52.630
Not really.

17:52.630 --> 17:54.010
Or are you scared?

17:54.010 --> 17:56.090
I'm not scared of a little kiss!

17:56.090 --> 17:58.140
You brushed your teeth, didn't you?

17:59.090 --> 18:00.800
Then, here I go.

18:10.440 --> 18:12.860
Don't breathe, because it tickles.

18:58.820 --> 19:01.570
Definitely not something to do to kill time!

19:05.540 --> 19:07.870
All right, here we are. Hang on.

19:10.120 --> 19:11.380
Mr. Kaji!

19:11.380 --> 19:12.710
What?!

19:13.590 --> 19:14.500
Mr. Kaji!

19:17.920 --> 19:20.510
Well, I'll be leaving now.

19:20.510 --> 19:22.430
Why don't you stay with us, Kaji?

19:22.430 --> 19:25.100
I'd be laughed at if I went to work in this.

19:26.260 --> 19:28.060
It'll be okay.

19:28.060 --> 19:30.980
Hey, c'mon, Mr. Kaji...

19:30.980 --> 19:32.480
Later.

19:36.150 --> 19:38.150
He smelled of lavender...

19:39.190 --> 19:42.160
Please take care of Katsuragi.

19:42.160 --> 19:43.160
Sure.

19:43.160 --> 19:44.200
Well, 'night.

19:44.200 --> 19:45.780
Good night.

19:47.990 --> 19:50.460
What's wrong? You look down.

19:50.460 --> 19:52.960
It's because I kissed you!

19:53.830 --> 19:58.590
Well, let me call the girl's roll. Ayanami...

19:53.880 --> 19:55.420
NEXT DAY

19:58.590 --> 20:01.630
Oh, Ayanami's absent again?

20:03.050 --> 20:03.760
NERV HEADQUARTERS

20:03.840 --> 20:05.260
DEEP UNDERGROUND FACILITY
CENTRAL AREA

20:05.350 --> 20:06.260
CENTRAL DOGMA

20:27.370 --> 20:29.410
2008 METERS UNDERGROUND

20:29.490 --> 20:31.200
TERMINAL DOGMA

20:42.720 --> 20:45.300
Hi, how's your hangover?

20:45.300 --> 20:46.850
I'm finally sober now, thanks.

20:46.850 --> 20:47.970
Glad to hear it.

20:47.970 --> 20:51.810
Is this your day job, or your side job?

20:51.810 --> 20:52.890
I wonder which?

20:52.890 --> 20:56.690
Ryoji Kaji of Special Duty Organization Nerv's
Special Inspection Department...

20:56.690 --> 21:01.610
Also, Ryoji Kaji of the Investigation Department
of the Japanese Ministry of Home Affairs.

21:01.610 --> 21:02.690
So you know all about it.

21:02.690 --> 21:04.910
Don't underestimate Nerv.

21:04.910 --> 21:06.740
Is this an order from Commander Ikari?

21:06.740 --> 21:08.200
My own discretion.

21:08.200 --> 21:11.330
If you keep doing this other job, you'll die.

21:11.330 --> 21:14.540
Commander Ikari is using me.
I can still keep going.

21:14.920 --> 21:18.340
However, I will apologize for hiding it from you.

21:18.340 --> 21:20.750
I'll call it even in thanks for yesterday.

21:20.750 --> 21:23.340
Thanks very much, but...

21:23.340 --> 21:27.260
The Commander and Ritchan are hiding
things from you too, and...

21:27.260 --> 21:28.300
This is it.

21:34.770 --> 21:35.690
This is...

21:38.860 --> 21:40.650
Eva? No!

21:41.440 --> 21:42.480
Impossible...

21:42.480 --> 21:48.410
Yes, this is the origin and linchpin of
everything since the Second Impact.

21:49.160 --> 21:50.410
This is Adam.

21:50.410 --> 21:53.410
Adam? The First Angel is here?

21:54.580 --> 21:55.870
You're right.

21:55.870 --> 21:59.000
Nerv is deeper in this than I thought.

21:59.040 --> 22:00.590
TO BE CONTINUED

23:06.070 --> 23:06.940
PREVIEW

23:07.400 --> 23:10.950
The puffed-up Shinji gets swallowed
in a Sea of Dirac.

23:10.950 --> 23:14.700
The short amount of time left to him
teaches him the meaning of despair.

23:14.700 --> 23:18.200
Next episode: "The Sickness Unto Death, And..."

23:18.200 --> 23:20.460
More fan service next time!

23:18.960 --> 23:21.040
THE SICKNESS UNTO DEATH, AND...
